<view class="page safe-area fade-in-up">
  <view class="hero card card--dark">
    <view class="badge">SBTI · 友情版</view>
    <view class="title-xl">你们是什么类型的朋友圈？</view>
    <view class="subtitle">测出你们的友情人格 · 纯属娱乐</view>

    <view class="picker-block">
      <view class="picker-label">参与人数</view>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{participantLabels}}"
        value="{{pickerIndex}}"
        bindchange="onParticipantChange"
      >
        <view class="picker-value">
          <text class="picker-num">{{groupSize}}</text>
          <text class="picker-unit">人</text>
          <text class="picker-hint">点击修改</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="onStart">START 开始测验</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-hint">适合 2–10 人一起填报 · 题目为示意表述</view>
</view>
